    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506750/extras/e4cdb688057cb584290056bb828bee87.poster.avif?t=1748340660\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506750/extras/e4cdb688057cb584290056bb828bee87.webm?t=1748340660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506750/extras/e4cdb688057cb584290056bb828bee87.mp4?t=1748340660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal, smash, and survive in this high-speed vehicular roguelike! You play as <i>Monster Punk</i>, an outlaw behind the wheel of a weaponized monster truck, pulling off insane heists in a lawless wasteland. Raid heavily guarded bases, outrun relentless robotic enforcers and upgrade your ride to take on bigger, deadlier targets. The bigger the heist, the bigger the chaos...  <br><strong>can you escape the madness and make it out alive &amp; rich? </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506750/extras/517eb5e57c79d637571af2ab5a4e5822.poster.avif?t=1748340660\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506750/extras/517eb5e57c79d637571af2ab5a4e5822.webm?t=1748340660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506750/extras/517eb5e57c79d637571af2ab5a4e5822.mp4?t=1748340660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every heist is a <strong>win-or-die</strong> gamble. Once you blast your way in, <strong>you better be ready, because the moment the alarms go on, there\u2019s no turning back</strong>! With <strong>No time to breathe</strong>, you're constantly on the run, <strong>fighting off deadly robotic enforcers</strong> who will stop at nothing to take you down. <strong>Drift, boost, and jump your way through the chaos, blasting enemies, running them over, and smashing through anything in your path.</strong> The bigger the risk, the bigger the reward. use your scores to <strong>upgrade your monster truck with better weapons, armor, and speed</strong> to take on even riskier heists. Only the boldest outlaws make it out alive. Will you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506750/extras/b68fff59867730b138907e9e1d37b5e2.poster.avif?t=1748340660\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506750/extras/b68fff59867730b138907e9e1d37b5e2.webm?t=1748340660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506750/extras/b68fff59867730b138907e9e1d37b5e2.mp4?t=1748340660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Your truck is more than a getaway vehicle, it\u2019s a <strong>destruction machine</strong>! Upgrade its weapons, boost speed, improve armor, and tweak handling to survive longer, steal bigger, and escape faster. Equip devastating <strong>guns, rams, and turbo boosters</strong>, then hit the wasteland in style. Build the <strong>ultimate outlaw ride</strong> and turn your monster truck into a war machine! <br>   </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506750/extras/e4cdb688057cb584290056bb828bee87.poster.avif?t=1748340660\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506750/extras/e4cdb688057cb584290056bb828bee87.webm?t=1748340660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506750/extras/e4cdb688057cb584290056bb828bee87.mp4?t=1748340660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal, smash, and survive in this high-speed vehicular roguelike! You play as <i>Monster Punk</i>, an outlaw behind the wheel of a weaponized monster truck, pulling off insane heists in a lawless wasteland. Raid heavily guarded bases, outrun relentless robotic enforcers and upgrade your ride to take on bigger, deadlier targets. The bigger the heist, the bigger the chaos...  <br><strong>can you escape the madness and make it out alive &amp; rich? </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506750/extras/517eb5e57c79d637571af2ab5a4e5822.poster.avif?t=1748340660\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506750/extras/517eb5e57c79d637571af2ab5a4e5822.webm?t=1748340660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506750/extras/517eb5e57c79d637571af2ab5a4e5822.mp4?t=1748340660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every heist is a <strong>win-or-die</strong> gamble. Once you blast your way in, <strong>you better be ready, because the moment the alarms go on, there\u2019s no turning back</strong>! With <strong>No time to breathe</strong>, you're constantly on the run, <strong>fighting off deadly robotic enforcers</strong> who will stop at nothing to take you down. <strong>Drift, boost, and jump your way through the chaos, blasting enemies, running them over, and smashing through anything in your path.</strong> The bigger the risk, the bigger the reward. use your scores to <strong>upgrade your monster truck with better weapons, armor, and speed</strong> to take on even riskier heists. Only the boldest outlaws make it out alive. Will you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506750/extras/b68fff59867730b138907e9e1d37b5e2.poster.avif?t=1748340660\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506750/extras/b68fff59867730b138907e9e1d37b5e2.webm?t=1748340660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506750/extras/b68fff59867730b138907e9e1d37b5e2.mp4?t=1748340660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Your truck is more than a getaway vehicle, it\u2019s a <strong>destruction machine</strong>! Upgrade its weapons, boost speed, improve armor, and tweak handling to survive longer, steal bigger, and escape faster. Equip devastating <strong>guns, rams, and turbo boosters</strong>, then hit the wasteland in style. Build the <strong>ultimate outlaw ride</strong> and turn your monster truck into a war machine! <br>   </p>",
    "short_description": "Drift, boost, smash, and blast through chaotic heists in a monster truck roguelike. Raid high-security bases, gun down robotic guards, grab as much loot as you can, and escape before time runs out. Upgrade your truck, unlock new zones, and push your luck for bigger scores... if you dare...",
